# A stand-in fstab for the samples, with one line for a throwaway folder that nothing is
# mounted on. <tmp> is a placeholder: samples/README.md replaces it with a temporary
# folder before the run. The UUID is an obvious fake, and nothing ever looks it up.
UUID=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001 <tmp>/throwaway apfs rw,nobrowse
